agents-orchestrator release tag v9.0.0 (e02896d), /agent/v1 paths only (method, operationId and, when the operation declares any, its query parameter names). Re-vendored from its openapi.json: for each path starting with /agent/v1 write {"paths": {path: {method: {"operationId": id, "query": [sorted query parameter names, omitted when none]}}}} with sorted keys and indent 1.
